from pathlib import Path
from html import escape
import json,sympy as sy
R=Path(__file__).parent;d=json.loads((R/'exact-algebraic.json').read_text());v=json.loads((R/'verification.json').read_text());assert v['exactStationarityVerified'];assert json.loads((R/'../n12-s8-minimum/independent-verification.json').read_text())['globalOptimalityProven']
def tex(s):return '<div class="proof-equation" data-tex="'+escape(s,quote=True)+'"></div>'
s='<section class="intro"><div class="intro-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Exact analytical representative · 4 November 2026</p><h1>Twelve qubits:<br><em>the exact S<sub>8</sub> minimum</em></h1><p class="intro-description">The previously numerical state now has an exact isolated-root construction. Attainment, full complex stationarity and global minimality are proved.</p></div></section><section class="reference-section" id="state"><h2>Explicit Dicke coefficients</h2><p>Let B be the unique real root in the interval below of the degree-fourteen polynomial P, and set A and T as follows:</p>'
s+=tex(r'0.545145081209058800411903120372830654783598761471931414318226328500<B<0.545145081209058800411903120372830654783598761471931414318226328501.')
s+=tex(r'A=\frac{R(B)}{D(B)},\qquad T=\frac{308AB^2+64AB-1435B^2+112B+570}{158A^2+768AB+672B-1220}>0.')
s+=tex(r'Q=12A^2T+495B^2+792T+66.')
s+=tex(r'\boxed{|\psi_\star\rangle=\frac{\sqrt{12}\,A\sqrt T\,|D_{12}^{(1)}\rangle+\sqrt{495}\,B|D_{12}^{(4)}\rangle+\sqrt{792T}\,|D_{12}^{(7)}\rangle+\sqrt{66}\,|D_{12}^{(10)}\rangle}{\sqrt Q}.}')
s+='<p>The square roots are the positive real branches. The normalized nonzero amplitudes are approximately</p>'+tex(r'(c_1,c_4,c_7,c_{10})=(0.2698136900462591503,\ 0.5511240512973848824,\ 0.6979890897422028223,\ 0.3691531976646414036).')
s+='<details><summary>Explicit defining polynomials P, R and D</summary>'
for label,key in [('P','Bpolynomial'),('R','Anumerator'),('D','Adenominator')]:s+=tex(label+'(B)='+sy.latex(sy.sympify(d[key])))
s+='</details><p><a href="exact-algebraic.json" download>Exact formulas, isolated root and 100-digit coefficients ↓</a></p></section><section class="reference-section" id="value"><h2>Exactly attained value</h2>'
s+=tex(r'S_8(\psi_\star)=s_\star=223.307697897758835462996453944667621509\ldots')
s+='<p>The value has algebraic degree fourteen. Its polynomial and certified isolating interval are supplied in the <a href="value-polynomial.json">exact value certificate</a>. It is the global minimum, as established by the <a href="../n12-s8-minimum/index.html">sharp algebraic sum-of-squares certificate</a>.</p></section><section class="reference-section" id="verification"><h2>What is proved</h2><p>The independent verifier derives the sector polynomial directly from reduced density matrices, isolates the specified root, checks nonzero denominators and positive square-root branches, and verifies the stationary equations exactly in the associated real number field. The support lies in one residue class modulo three, forcing off-support derivatives to vanish. Conjugation invariance makes all imaginary-direction derivatives vanish for this real representative. Together these checks establish full complex stationarity. The separate <a href="../n12-s8-minimum/index.html">global SOS proof</a> establishes optimality.</p><p><a href="verification.json">Exact verification report ↗</a> · <a href="verify_exact.py">Independent verifier ↓</a> · <a href="derive.py">Derivation and high-precision refinement ↓</a></p><pre>python3 -m pip install -r requirements.txt\npython3 verify_exact.py</pre><p><a href="requirements.txt">Verifier dependencies</a></p></section>'
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Twelve-qubit S8 algebraic minimum</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../../styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../../vendor/katex/katex.min.css"><script src="../../vendor/katex/katex.min.js" defer></script><style>.proof-equation{overflow-x:auto;margin:1.4rem 0;padding:.4rem 0}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;padding:1rem}main{max-width:1100px}details{margin:1.4rem 0}</style></head><body><header class="site-header"><a class="wordmark" href="../../index.html#n=12&amp;k=8&amp;mode=min">← Sector-length catalogue</a></header><main>'''+s+'''</main><footer class="site-footer"><a href="../index.html">All proofs and remaining gaps ↗</a></footer><script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>document.querySelectorAll('[data-tex]').forEach(el=>el.innerHTML=katex.renderToString(el.dataset.tex,{displayMode:true,throwOnError:false,trust:false})));</script></body></html>''';(R/'index.html').write_text(html)
